---
import LayoutNew from '../layouts/LayoutNew.astro';
---

<LayoutNew title="About - Dairy Velvet">
  <!-- Page header -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 text-center" style="background-color: #EAD7BF;">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: #BE8D5A;">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="dv-serif font-bold text-5xl" style="color: #1A0E07;">About Us</h1>
  </section>

  <!-- About: image + text -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4" style="background-color: #F8F3EC;">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12">
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md">
        <img src="/images/gallery6.jpg" alt="About Dairy Velvet" class="w-full h-80 object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:w-1/2">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: #BE8D5A;">Where It Started</p>
        <h2 class="dv-serif font-bold text-4xl leading-tight mb-6" style="color: #1A0E07;">A taste of home, shared with the world</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: #5C3A20;">
          We come from Eastern Europe, where this creamy chocolate-coated dairy treat - known as Syrok - is a childhood favorite.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: #5C3A20;">
          Wanting to share those memories, we first started making it at home to indulge our kids and let them taste the sweetness of our own childhood. Soon it became more than just a family dessert - our friends' kids and adults alike fell in love with it.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: #5C3A20;">
          Over time, we refined the recipe to make it lighter, healthier, and more balanced, while keeping the same rich, indulgent taste we grew up with. Now we're excited to share this beloved snack with our community, so everyone can enjoy the joy, comfort, and happiness it brings.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Second image + text reversed -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4" style="background-color: #EAD7BF;">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12">
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 order-1 lg:order-2 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md">
        <img src="/images/gallery5.jpg" alt="Dairy Velvet snacks" class="w-full h-80 object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 order-2 lg:order-1">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: #BE8D5A;">Our Mission</p>
        <h2 class="dv-serif font-bold text-4xl leading-tight mb-6" style="color: #1A0E07;">Local dairy, honest ingredients</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: #5C3A20;">
          By sourcing our dairy from local Pennsylvania farmers, we support our community while bringing you the freshest, most honest ingredients possible.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: #5C3A20;">
          Every Dairy Velvet bar is made in small batches - high in protein, low in sugar, and free from anything artificial. The same treat we grew up loving, made the right way.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo gallery -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4" style="background-color: #F8F3EC;">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
      <img src="/images/gallery4.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      <img src="/images/gallery1.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      <img src="/images/about-bars.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      <img src="/images/gallery2.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      <img src="/images/product-cut.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
      <img src="/images/gallery3.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-xl" />
    </div>
  </section>
</LayoutNew>
